3,Dewoin - docs.verbix.com,https://docs.verbix.com/EndangeredLanguages/Dewoin,"Dewoin language information Facts Language: Dewoin Alternate names: De, Dey, Dei, Dewoi Language code: dee Language family: Niger-Congo, Atlantic-Congo, Volta-Congo ...",Dewoin,Niger-Congo
4,Niger Music - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLnOSH5j1sQh-Cc6WWJaGiwwXtA73IPncK,"Niger is a Saharan African nation with numerous ethnic groups: Hausa, Taureg, Fulani, Zarma, Wodaabe, Sagolo, Kanori, Sogha, Djerma, etc.",Dewoin,Niger-Congo
5,Nouveauté Musique Congolaise 2026 - Top Congolese Music Hits ... - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLZ6afNou8CGtrmKVq9jLTR9PDvyGaveWM,"Découvrez la ""Nouveauté Musique Congolaise 2026"" et plongez dans les ""Top Congolese Music Hits 2026-2027 Playlist"" qui célèbre la richesse musicale de la République Démocratique du Congo.",Dewoin,Niger-Congo
6,Dewoin in Liberia Profile - Joshua Project,https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/print/11541/LI,"The Dewoin language belongs to the Kru family of Niger-Congo languages and shares significant vocabulary with the neighboring Bassa language. It is a tongue that carries the memory of this people — their oral traditions, their ceremonies, their ways of naming the world.",Dewoin,Niger-Congo
7,Dewoin in Liberia people group profile | Joshua Project,https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/11541/LI,"The Dewoin language belongs to the Kru family of Niger-Congo languages and shares significant vocabulary with the neighboring Bassa language. It is a tongue that carries the memory of this people — their oral traditions, their ceremonies, their ways of naming the world.",Dewoin,Niger-Congo
8,Dewoin - lingweb.eva.mpg.de,https://lingweb.eva.mpg.de/channumerals/Dewoin.htm,"Other comments: Dewoin has a quinary, vigesimal system. Dewoi, Dey is spoken by approximately 17,000 speakers in Bomi county: coast between Lofa and Saint Paul rivers; Montserrado county: near coast, Liberia.",Dewoin,Niger-Congo
9,Dewoin - dee (Niger-Congo) - PeopleGroups.org,https://www.peoplegroups.org/language/dee/,"Dewoin – dee is in the Niger-Congo family, included in Niger-Congo, Atlantic-Congo, Volta-Congo, Kru, Western, Bassa language class.",Dewoin,Niger-Congo
